+## Hardening round 39 (external FINDINGS — 4 items, closed PE schema & capability integration)
+
+Round-38 contracts (versioned PE schema, publication capability, machine-validated diagnostic)
+were accepted and are FROZEN. External review of the round-38 package returned four
+bounded findings. Round 39 closes exactly these four and broadens no further.
+
+### Closed
+* **F1 — ProviderTokenEvidence is neither versioned nor closed.** Created
+  `packages/orchestration/provider_token_evidence.py` as the single source of truth:
+  `PROVIDER_TOKEN_EVIDENCE_SCHEMA_VERSION = "1.0.0"`, closed `ALLOWED_FIELDS` (~50 fields),
+  `SUPPORTED_EXECUTION_MODES` enum, required field sets by execution mode, and
+  `validate_provider_token_evidence(pe, ctx)`. Integrated into `token_truth.py` before semantic
+  validation. Replaced `provider_call_count` inference fallback with hard error. Fixed
+  `has_actual_counters` to check only core actual tokens (prompt/completion/total), not
+  supplementary cache metadata. Updated all production PE writers (pingpong_loop, repair_attest,
+  manual_attestation, pingpong_evidence) to emit `schema_version` and `execution_mode`. 202
+  tests across 4 suites updated and passing.
+* **F2 — diagnostic comparison has no product producer or validator.** Created
+  `packages/orchestration/diagnostic_comparison.py` with `produce_diagnostic_comparison()` and
+  `validate_diagnostic_comparison()`. The producer accepts pre-collected failure node IDs, sorts
+  and deduplicates them, computes SHA-256 hashes, and derives `failure_sets_equal` and set
+  differences — no field is caller-asserted. The validator recomputes every derived field
+  independently. Schema version 2.0.0. 23 contract tests.
+* **F3 — required authoritative verification is incomplete.** Created
+  `packages/orchestration/verification_matrix.py` with `produce_verification_run()`,
+  `produce_verification_tests()`, and `validate_verification_completeness()`. The run producer
+  validates types (rejects bool-as-int, negative counts, malformed run_id). The tests producer
+  derives all top-level fields from individual runs. The completeness validator checks all
+  required suites are present and counts match. Producer output passes the existing
+  `VerificationTestsV1` validator. 23 contract tests.
+* **F4 — capability probe is not integrated.** Integrated
+  `probe_anonymous_publication_capability()` into `build_review_zip.py` coordinator before
+  publication. Unsupported capability returns exit code 4 with typed JSON
+  (`publication_capability`, `publication_capability_directory`). Supported capability records
+  `publication_capability` in the coordinator's success JSON output. 11 contract tests.
+
+### Authoritative verification (20 suites, 651 passed, 0 failed)
+test_review_atomic_publish (32), test_token_truth_v1_contract (101),
+test_token_truth (37), test_token_authority (13), test_review_token_truth_authority (15),
+test_review_manual_completion_shapes (18), test_review_single_publication (7),
+test_review_package_full_integration (8), test_review_authoritative_e2e (1),
+test_token_producer_validator_compat (8), test_docs_consistency (275),
+test_review_archive_plan (10), test_provider_evidence_integration (56),
+test_stream_export_e2e (7), test_diagnostic_comparison (23),
+test_verification_matrix (23), test_coordinator_capability_integration (11),
+compileall (clean), bash -n (clean), git diff --check (clean).
+
